  PyMuPDF (pymupdf)            AGPL-3.0 / commercial (Artifex)
  numpy                        BSD-3-Clause
  opencv-python-headless       Apache-2.0 (OpenCV); wheel also bundles FFmpeg
                               and other libraries under their own licences
  PyYAML                       MIT
  The exact versions are in requirements.txt. Check each package's licence
  file in your environment.

Programs run as separate processes (not linked):
  Tesseract OCR (tesseract-ocr)  Apache-2.0
  systemd, cifs-utils            their own licences

Fonts (shipped in share/fonts/, unmodified, with their licence texts):
